rigs in section 6.1)\n893:### 5.12 Bosses (`53-bosses.js`)\n912:### 5.13 Escort — Tobei (`54-escort.js`, M2)\n924:### 5.14 Missions: objectives, triggers, checkpoints, timers (`60-mission.js`)\n951:### 5.15 Score, ranks, unlocks, saves (`61-score.js`)\n972:### 5.16 Story presentation (`62-story.js`, `63-cutscene.js`)\n983:### 5.17 Audio (`10-audio.js`, `11-voice.js`) — all code, no files\n1045:### 5.18 Visuals, assets, animation (engine-native look, PS1-era pixel art)\n1158:### 5.19 Attract mode (`81-attract.js`, `80-autopilot.js`)\n1194:### 5.20 Dev mode (`74-dev.js`) — pause menu → **Dev Mode** (not offered in hub sessions or attract)\n1272:### 5.21 Mission Editor — \"Workshop\" (`75-workshop.js`)\n1314:### 5.22 Multiplayer — AI Hub ghost mode, and the Shadow Trial on its own (`82-hub.js`)\n1382:### 5.23 About / Credits (title → About; paged)\n1397:## 6. Content\n1399:### 6.1 Characters and rigs (`21-rigs.js`)\n1423:### 6.2 Missions\n1431:#### Mission 0 — \"The Trial of the Second Tier\" (training; 40×28; dusk turning to night; petals; music `training`)\n1434:####################\n1435:#AAAAAA..FFFF\"\"\"\"\"\"\"#   A the Jubako-ya shop (h40)   F bamboo fence (vault)   \" bamboo grove\n1436:#AAAAAA....,,\"\"\"1\"\"\"#   1 Disciple Ume (lantern, slow loop in the grove)\n1437:#..@..........\"\"\"\"\"\"#   @ start, the back porch (Granny watches from the door)\n1438:#..PP....W.W......C.#   P planters (cover)   W low walls h30 (climb)   C kura storehouse h48\n1439:#..PP....W.W....CCCC#\n1440:#.......~~~~~...CCCC#   ~ koi pond (deep): Disciple Kiku (2) stands at the bank\n1441:#..,,,..~~~~~2..CC3C#   3 Disciple Masa below the kura's edge (the from-above mark target)\n1442:#.............t..b..#   t persimmon tree (grapple anchor)   b bait test spot (training dummy guard \"Big Daikon\")\n1443:#..:::::::::........#   : raked-gravel sparring ring (Brother Ittetsu)\n1444:#..:::::::::...dd...#   d practice dummies (combo practice)\n1445:####################\n1463:#### Missio