{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh9vNRGK71iWBDtA7F8N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PlayStation and Xbox prompts render correctly. The d-pad hints under the tool box are cut off at the screen edge; moving them up. Then the dev page and the patch list."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2740,"cache_read_input_tokens":897638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2740},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"f95e60e9-61e4-4f46-883f-a47e73a60336","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:10:53.281Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh9vN79sstetamBB2hAm"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh9vNRGK71iWBDtA7F8N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TZEdDkfyCwyNsUNJkAfGbu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/70-hud.js'; s=open(p,encoding='utf8').read()\nold=\"if (Glyph.device() === 'pad') { Glyph.draw(g, 'toolPrev', bx - 28, by + 30); Glyph.draw(g, 'toolNext', bx + 34, by + 30); }\"\nnew=\"if (Glyph.device() === 'pad') { Glyph.draw(g, 'toolPrev', bx - 17, by + 19); Glyph.draw(g, 'toolNext', Math.min(r.W - 11, bx + 33), by + 19); }\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w',encoding='utf8').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\ncat > index.html <<'EOF'\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script src=\"vendor/aihub/session.js\"></script>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"ghost\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"5\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Silent kills, unseen, fast: top ninja score wins\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Move WASD/stick · Strike click/□ · Jump Space/✕ · Crouch C/○ · Tool R/R2\">\n<title>Bentou 2 (dev page)</title>\n<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#000;overflow:hidden}#screen{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;touch-action:none}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"screen\"></canvas>\n<!-- the dev page: the engine, then the built game script (node tools/build.mjs --js writes build/game.js from src/ in order) -->\n<script src=\"engine/my-3d2dge.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"build/game.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\nEOF\ncat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Changes to my-3D2dge v0.85.2 for Bentou 2\n\nEvery change is marked `// BENTOU PATCH n` in `my-3d2dge.js`. Each is small; nothing in the engine was refactored.\n\n1. **Pixel font glyphs.** The PlayStation face symbols (✕ ○ □ △), ◀ ▶, and · ° — … ’ ‘ ∞ ✓ ✗ added to the 5x7 font, so\n   `input.label()` text and the game's lines draw in canvas text instead of `?`.\n2. **Button symbols setting.** PlayStation by default; the option is Xbox (A B X Y). TASK.md asks for PlayStation glyphs\n   with a Settings option for Xbox.\n3. **Humanoid gear.** `mask: { color, style: 'cloth' | 'oni' }` (a cloth wrap over nose and mouth, or a red oni face with\n   brows, tusks and a horn; it hides the mouth and shows in portraits); hats `jingasa` and `kabuto` (with a crest); weapons\n   `spear` (yari), `bow` (yumi, drawn when `point`), `club` (kanabo); `offhand: { len }` (a second short blade);\n   `sashimono: color` (a back banner). The period's look needs them.\n4. **Shell: custom rows.** A custom screen's spec can carry `rows: [settingKeys]`, drawn as settings rows (the Dev Mode\n   slider pages); settings in group `Dev` never appear on the player's Settings screen.\n5. **Shell: hover moves the focus.** A mouse over a button or slider focuses it (TASK.md: hover moves the focus).\n6. **Shell: the 10-foot scale.** `--ui` grows with the window's height (`clamp(1, innerHeight / 720 x size, 3)`), applied\n   by CSS zoom on panels, toasts and prompts; the Interface size setting (Auto, Normal, Large, Huge); base text 16 px,\n   buttons at least 52 px tall; a panel never taller than the screen.\n7. **Music envelopes.** Per track `pluck: true` (a ringing, decaying note over `ring` seconds: koto, shamisen), `attack`\n   and `release` (the shakuhachi's slow attack).\n8. **Voice bus.** `audio.voiceBus`, a gain on the master with its own volume (`audio.voiceVolume`, the Voices setting),\n   for the gibberish voices.\n9. **Hub pause guard.** In an AI Hub session, Options is ignored while Create is held (the hub owns that pair).\nEOF\necho done","description":"Fix d-pad hint, add dev page and patch list"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2740,"cache_read_input_tokens":897638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2740},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"9734a2cc-c50a-4538-a3ff-b2fe81e25abc","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:11:08.388Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh9vN79sstetamBB2hAm","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01TZEdDkfyCwyNsUNJkAfGbu":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/work/Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/70-hud.js'; s=open(p,encoding='utf8').read()\nold=\"if (Glyph.device() === 'pad') { Glyph.draw(g, 'toolPrev', bx - 28, by + 30); Glyph.draw(g, 'toolNext', bx + 34, by + 30); }\"\nnew=\"if (Glyph.device() === 'pad') { Glyph.draw(g, 'toolPrev', bx - 17, by + 19); Glyph.draw(g, 'toolNext', Math.min(r.W - 11, bx + 33), by + 19); }\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w',encoding='utf8').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\ncat > index.html <<'EOF'\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script src=\"vendor/aihub/session.js\"></script>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"ghost\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"5\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Silent kills, unseen, fast: top ninja score wins\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Move WASD/stick · Strike click/□ · Jump Space/✕ · Crouch C/○ · Tool R/R2\">\n<title>Bentou 2 (dev page)</title>\n<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#000;overflow:hidden}#screen{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;touch-action:none}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"screen\"></canvas>\n<!-- the dev page: the engine, then the built game script (node tools/build.mjs --js writes build/game.js from src/ in order) -->\n<script src=\"engine/my-3d2dge.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"build/game.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\nEOF\ncat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Changes to my-3D2dge v0.85.2 for Bentou 2\n\nEvery change is marked `// BENTOU PATCH n` in `my-3d2dge.js`. Each is small; nothing in the engine was refactored.\n\n1. **Pixel font glyphs.** The PlayStation face symbols (✕ ○ □ △), ◀ ▶, and · ° — … ’ ‘ ∞ ✓ ✗ added to the 5x7 font, so\n   `input.label()` text and the game's lines draw in canvas text instead of `?`.\n2. **Button symbols setting.** PlayStation by default; the option is Xbox (A B X Y). TASK.md asks for PlayStation glyphs\n   with a Settings option for Xbox.\n3. **Humanoid gear.** `mask: { color, style: 'cloth' | 'oni' }` (a cloth wrap over nose and mouth, or a red oni face with\n   brows, tusks and a horn; it hides the mouth and shows in portraits); hats `jingasa` and `kabuto` (with a crest); weapons\n   `spear` (yari), `bow` (yumi, drawn when `point`), `club` (kanabo); `offhand: { len }` (a second short blade);\n   `sashimono: color` (a back banner). The period's look needs them.\n4. **Shell: custom rows.** A custom screen's spec can carry `rows: [settingKeys]`, drawn as settings rows (the Dev Mode\n   slider pages); settings in group `Dev` never appear on the player's Settings screen.\n5. **Shell: hover moves the focus.** A mouse over a button or slider focuses it (TASK.md: hover moves the focus).\n6. **Shell: the 10-foot scale.** `--ui` grows with the window's height (`clamp(1, innerHeight / 720 x size, 3)`), applied\n   by CSS zoom on panels, toasts and prompts; the Interface size setting (Auto, Normal, Large, Huge); base text 16 px,\n   buttons at least 52 px tall; a panel never taller than the screen.\n7. **Music envelopes.** Per track `pluck: true` (a ringing, decaying note over `ring` seconds: koto, shamisen), `attack`\n   and `release` (the shakuhachi's slow attack).\n8. **Voice bus.** `audio.voiceBus`, a gain on the master with its own volume (`audio.voiceVolume`, the Voices setting),\n   for the gibberish voices.\n9. **Hub pause guard.** In an AI Hub session, Options is ignored while Create is held (the hub owns that pair).\nEOF\necho done","description":"Fix d-pad hint, add dev page and patch list"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01TZEdDkfyCwyNsUNJkAfGbu":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/work/Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331"}}}
