less); Linux; browser unknown\n- **Model:** Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort xhigh\n- **Usage:** API cost and tokens: unknown (not visible to the agent). Session time: about 2 hours (18:33 to about 20:40).\n\n## Testing Feedback\n\n\n**How many issues did testing catch?**\n26. The scripted tests caught 17 (in the game, the autopilot and the level data) and screenshot reviews caught 9 visual and layout issues.\n\n**How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?**\n4: guards attacking Tobei while he was still caged (the alarm bell could fail Kiri Lake), the water-gate lever taken by Tobei's wait / follow toggle (it blocked the escort), sleeping guards woken by their own snores (it broke the Sleep Dango and a Trial step), and the roof caps drawing over people standing on a roof (Kurogane's fight on the keep top was hidden).\n\n**What was the most helpful test you ran?**\nThe scripted playthrough of the whole story (autopilot routes through all four missions, the ending, the credits, Kaede's run and the Night Delivery). It found both Tobei bugs and the fight and timeout problems.\n\n**What was the least helpful test you ran?**","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LoQSYZsKFAXzmmkbumHDRx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
