{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y5Naq6MigER9o96v2BQYQB","type":"tool_result","content":"1:    '# Testing', 'One command (node tests/run.mjs: failures only and a one-line count, 287 checks): 21 suites in fresh node:vm pages driven by game.advance and game.debug, among them a scripted playthrough of the whole story, three attract loops and a mock hub; Playwright checks of the single file from file://; the real AI Hub harness (2 players; 4 with latency 150, jitter 50, loss 5; the host leaving); screenshots only for the look',\n5:    '# How many issues did testing catch?', '26. The scripted tests caught 17 (in the game, the autopilot and the level data) and screenshot reviews caught 9 visual and layout issues.',\n6:    '# How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?', '4: guards attacking Tobei while he was still caged (the alarm bell could fail Kiri Lake), the water-gate lever taken by Tobei\\'s wait / follow toggle (it blocked the escort), sleeping guards woken by their own snores (it broke the Sleep Dango and a Trial step), and the roof caps drawing over people standing on a roof (Kurogane\\'s fight on the keep top was hidden).',\n7:    '# What was the most helpful test you ran?', 'The scripted playthrough of the whole story (autopilot routes through all four missions, the ending, the credits, Kaede\\'s run and the Night Delivery). It found both Tobei bugs and the fight and timeout problems.',\n10:    '# What did you like most about the engine?', 'One height rule shared by collision, sight, reach and navigation: a TileMap with heights, E.Mover\\'s parkour, E.sees, E.Suspicion and FlowField gave a working stealth sandbox almost at once, and exact fixed-step headless play (game.advance) made scripted playthroughs and a mock hub easy.',\n19:    '# What was the hardest thing to do?', 'The scope: four missions with bosses, a mission editor, hub multiplayer, attract mode and dev tools in one pass, judging the look only from headless screenshots.',\n22","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"80ed6aa0-de2b-49d0-884e-eb91f09fa1c5","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:31:32.895Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1:    '# Testing', 'One command (node tests/run.mjs: failures only and a one-line count, 287 checks): 21 suites in fresh node:vm pages driven by game.advance and game.debug, among them a scripted playthrough of the whole story, three attract loops and a mock hub; Playwright checks of the single file from file://; the real AI Hub harness (2 players; 4 with latency 150, jitter 50, loss 5; the host leaving); screenshots only for the look',\n5:    '# How many issues did testing catch?', '26. The scripted tests caught 17 (in the game, the autopilot and the level data) and screenshot reviews caught 9 visual and layout issues.',\n6:    '# How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?', '4: guards attacking Tobei while he was still caged (the alarm bell could fail Kiri Lake), the water-gate lever taken by Tobei\\'s wait / follow toggle (it blocked the escort), sleeping guards woken by their own snores (it broke the Sleep Dango and a Trial step), and the roof caps drawing over people standing on a roof (Kurogane\\'s fight on the keep top was hidden).',\n7:    '# What was the most helpful test you ran?', 'The scripted playthrough of the whole story (autopilot routes through all four missions, the ending, the credits, Kaede\\'s run and the Night Delivery). It found both Tobei bugs and the fight and timeout problems.',\n10:    '# What did you like most about the engine?', 'One height rule shared by collision, sight, reach and navigation: a TileMap with heights, E.Mover\\'s parkour, E.sees, E.Suspicion and FlowField gave a working stealth sandbox almost at once, and exact fixed-step headless play (game.advance) made scripted playthroughs and a mock hub easy.',\n19:    '# What was the hardest thing to do?', 'The scope: four missions with bosses, a mission editor, hub multiplayer, attract mode and dev tools in one pass, judging the look only from headless screenshots.',\n22","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Y5Naq6MigER9o96v2BQYQB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
