{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019p5x7GAEdDU6TikHw4iQCb","type":"tool_result","content":"2426:  rotateView(deg) { this.yaw = (((this.yaw || 0) + deg) % 360 + 360) % 360; this._applyView(); }\n2427-  /** undo setZoom and rotateView: the scene's own zoom again (camera.start, or camera.tall on a screen held upright; 1\n2428-   *  without), no turn. The player's zoom stays (settings.zoom) */\n2429-  resetCamera() { this.yaw = 0; this._zoomBase = this._zoomStart(); this._zoomApply(true); }\nThe draw was 26, so entry #27 won: **\"Bentou 2: Birth of the Lunchbox Assassins\"**. It riffs on *Tenchu 2: Birth of\nthe Stealth Assassins* (Tenchu → Bentou/bento; Stealth → Lunchbox). The world and story build on it: the \"2\" is the\ntwo-tier box and the two apprentices. The title screen shows **BENTOU 2** in large type with the subtitle *Birth of the\nLunchbox Assassins*.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"394849e8-02c3-4f32-90ae-1510e4ab8403","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:47:31.209Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"2426:  rotateView(deg) { this.yaw = (((this.yaw || 0) + deg) % 360 + 360) % 360; this._applyView(); }\n2427-  /** undo setZoom and rotateView: the scene's own zoom again (camera.start, or camera.tall on a screen held upright; 1\n2428-   *  without), no turn. The player's zoom stays (settings.zoom) */\n2429-  resetCamera() { this.yaw = 0; this._zoomBase = this._zoomStart(); this._zoomApply(true); }\nThe draw was 26, so entry #27 won: **\"Bentou 2: Birth of the Lunchbox Assassins\"**. It riffs on *Tenchu 2: Birth of\nthe Stealth Assassins* (Tenchu → Bentou/bento; Stealth → Lunchbox). The world and story build on it: the \"2\" is the\ntwo-tier box and the two apprentices. The title screen shows **BENTOU 2** in large type with the subtitle *Birth of the\nLunchbox Assassins*.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta