title on the title screen, SOURCE TASK.md\\'s first line, written whole', 'SOURCE is read from this line'],","+    ['about > it answers every Source Information field', 'the source is named in Source Information']]],","+  [3, 'Genre: Pick the game genre', [   // stealth-action: light and shadow, sound, takedowns, alarms, swordplay, bosses","+    ['perception > a lit hero 60 ahead is caught within 2 s', 'stealth: light gets you seen'],","+    ['perception > crouched in shadow at 100 stays calm', 'stealth: shadow hides you'],","+    ['perception > running at 50 is heard', 'stealth: noise carries'],","+    ['silentcut > sojiro: the choreography ends, the guard falls', 'stealth: an unseen kill from behind'],","+    ['alarm > an alert samurai runs for the bell', 'stealth: being seen escalates'],","+    ['combat > a parry inside the window staggers', 'action: swordplay with timing'],","+    ['bosses > kurogane: every move fires and works', 'action: boss duels']]],","+  [5, 'Perspective: Pick the camera perspective', [","+    ['task > Perspective: isometric (iso view), the camera turns 45 degrees a press each way', 'the iso view'],","+    ['task > Perspective: camRight turns +45, camLeft back and on to -45', 'turned by the player in 45-degree steps']]],","+  [7, 'pick one with a real random number generator', [","+    ['task > Game Title: the plan drew it with a real RNG from 50 (secrets.randbelow) and it is the title shown', 'drawn by secrets.randbelow(50), the title shown'],","+    ['browser/screens > About page 1 (About): shown, and every line of it drawn on the canvas', 'the title and its riff on the source, on screen']]],","+  [11, 'provide a single html file [GameTitle-SOURCE-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331.html]', [","+    ['task > Package: the single file is in the root under that name, and no other game file beside it', 'the file, in the root, under the TASK.md name'],","+    ['browser/play > the single file: the page loads nothing but itself', 'it needs no other file'],","+    ['browser/bundle > a mission plays from the single file', 'it plays from file://']]],","+  [13, 'Build on https://github.com/michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge/tree/main/dist/handoff', [","+    ['task > Tech stack: built on the my-3D2dge handoff engine (v0.85.2), changes marked', 'the handoff engine, its 9 changes marked'],","+    ['boot > the title after boot', 'the game runs on it']]],","+  [15, 'Make new art assets for whatever makes the game feel like the source', [","+    ['browser/play > art: the game\\'s own Japanese props are drawn in the mission (at least 6 kinds)', 'its own props drawn in a mission'],","+    ['task > Art: new art assets (Japanese props, materials, wall painters, icons, kanji)', 'registered with the engine']], ['shots/m-market.png', 'shots/m-keep.png', 'shots/m-hall.png']],","+  [17, 'Make new animations for whatever makes the game feel like the source', [","+    ['silentcut > sojiro: the cut starts its choreography', 'a paired takedown starts'],","+    ['silentcut > kaede: the choreography ends, the guard falls', 'and plays to its end'],","+    ['silentcut > undertow (kaede) runs to the end', 'every kind, both characters'],","+    ['grapple > a tap pulls the hero onto the roof', 'the grappling hook'],","+    ['story > prologue: granny taps', 'cutscene poses'], ['story > m3_fail: takanori toasts', 'cutscene poses']], ['shots/m-cut.png']],","+  [19, 'All music, sound effects and voices are written in code, with no audio files. Voices are Animalese/Simlish-style gibberish.', [","+    ['browser/play > voice: a spoken line is synthesized blips, at least one oscillator a syllable', 'voices: gibberish blips, one or more a syllable'],","+    ['browser/play > music: the step sequencer runs the score (the boss song, 140 bpm: about 28 steps in 3 s) and its notes are oscillators', 'music: sequenced in code'],","+    ['browser/play > audio: nothing decoded, no media element, no speech synthesis, no fetch', 'no audio file anywhere'],","+    [