{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghDx1PywE93jN3saLRVN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AiVqKwPgRuddH1amypSQuC","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"date +%H:%M && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/90-main.js'; s=open(p).read()\nreps=[\n(\"'The scripted playthrough of the whole story (autopilot routes through all four missions, the ending, the credits, Kaede\\\\'s run and the Night Delivery). It found both Tobei bugs and the fight and timeout problems.'\",\n \"'The scripted playthrough of the whole story (autopilot routes through all four missions, the ending, the credits, Kaede\\\\'s run and the Night Delivery). Of the 71 failure lines the test command printed this session, it printed 37, more than every other suite together, and it found 6 of the 27 issues (#2, #3 and #6 to #9 in tests/ISSUES.md), both Tobei bugs among them.'\"),\n(\"'The determinism hash test: it passed the first time and never caught anything.'\",\n \"'The determinism test (one check: the same inputs, played twice, give the same game): it never failed in any of the 55 and more test runs of the session, so it caught nothing.'\"),\n(\"Session time: about 2 hours 40 minutes (18:33 to about 21:15).\",\"Session time: about 3 hours (18:33 to about 21:35).\"),\n(\"'The plan\\\\'s file names carried another run\\\\'s model and timestamp;\",\"'The plan\\\\'s file names carried another run\\\\'s model and timestamp, and a short GameTitle (Bentou2) beside TASK.md\\\\'s own [GameTitle-SOURCE] rule;\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:80]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 && node tools/interview.mjs | tail -1 && node tests/run.mjs --fast about story task 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Update feedback answers and time, rebuild, check suites","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage"