{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghF6N1Zwo9Yhm7fLxs8K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook's remaining point: the verdict rests on my own mapping of checks to requirements, and some items are thin (Art, Narrative tone, \"feature-complete demo\"). TASK.md forbids subagents for auditing, so a second reviewer isn't available. What I can do is put raw evidence in the transcript that anyone can read without trusting my mapping:\n- the story's actual lines, for tone;\n- an event log from a scripted playthrough of every mission on the shipped code: objectives, takedowns by kind, tools used, alarms, boss defeats, ranks;\n- every one of the game's own shapes drawn per mission, for art.\n\nFirst I'll see what the game emits on its event bus, and how the playthrough suite drives the missions."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4584,"cache_read_input_tokens":272099,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4584},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"d21ea257-5c76-422b-bde9-89a08028c55d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:18:55.683Z","request_id":"req_011CghF6Mmvt3Jw3Ms3CHCtr"}
