{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LdCtMJS2MZQXNxu3pejjqS","type":"tool_result","content":"# Evidence from Bentou2BirthOfTheLunchboxAssassins-Tenchu2BirthOfTheStealthAssassins-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331.html (1.66 MB)\nIts inline scripts, run as they are below: aihub-session.js 16 KB sha256 6ab6be43898e · my-3d2dge.js 1216 KB sha256 18b5faa719c8 · game.js 469 KB sha256 36577eb8f27b\n\n## The playthrough, on the shipped scripts\n\n### The Trial of the Second Tier (training, sojiro, story): WON in 45 s · score 2100 · rank Makunouchi · then: results\nroute: 32 beats, 6 teleports, invisibility switched on in 1 beat(s), god mode on\nobjectives: vault done, ume done, kiku done, roof done, masa done, daikon done, smoke done, spar done, return done\nthe game reported: checkpoint ×4, voice lines spoken ×8, grapple ×1, tool poisonball ×1, pickup ×1, bait eaten (poison) ×1, kill by poison ×1, tool smoke ×1, parry ×1, riposte ×1\nboss defeated: Brother Ittetsu: \"...Well struck. She was right about you.\"\nsongs: training, boss, results\nheard in play: \"Is someone there?\" · \"Another cold night...\" · \"Haaah... (yawn)\" · \"Oh? A rice ball... nobody will miss it.\" · \"Ugh... my stomach...\" · \"Is that the moon or a rice cake? I am too hungry to know.\"\nthe game's own shapes placed: 17 kinds, 92 props\n\n### Rice and Ash (m1, sojiro, story): WON in 16 s · score 1625 · rank Ekiben · then: results\nroute: 14 beats, 3 teleports, invisibility switched on in 1 beat(s), god mode on\nobjectives: kill done, ledger (optional) done, boss done, escape done\nthe game reported: checkpoint ×2, grapple ×1, pickup ×1, Silent Cut (back) ×1, kill by cut ×1, voice lines spoken ×9, detected ×1, kill by strike ×1, parry ×1, kill by riposte ×1, riposte ×1\nboss defeated: Gonroku: \"The rice... was always... his...\"\nsongs: m1, boss, results\nheard in play: \"Please, spare me!\" · \"Guards! Guards!\" · \"Is someone there?\" · \"...Must have been the wind.\" · \"Hm? What was that?\" · \"Haaah... (yawn)\"\nthe game's own shapes placed: 20 kinds, 58 props\n\n### The Fort at Kiri Lake (m2, sojiro, story): WON in 20 s · score 2400 · rank Makunouchi · then: results\nroute: 18 beats, 5 teleports, invisibility switched on in 1 beat(s), god mode on\nobjectives: rescue done, gate done, boss done, escort done, barges (optional) done\nthe game reported: checkpoint ×3, voice lines spoken ×8, kill by strike ×1\nboss defeated: Hotaru: \"Hm. Sharper than you look. Tell your grandmother: on the night of the full moon, your lord drinks his last.\"\nsongs: m2, boss, results\nheard in play: \"You came! I knew you would.\" · \"Did that shadow move?\" · \"Nothing. Back to my post.\" · \"The barracks rice tastes of sand.\" · \"When does my watch end?\" · \"They say the Red Lanterns pay in silver.\"\nthe game's own shapes placed: 13 kinds, 36 props\n\n### Moon over Kokaku (m3, sojiro, story): WON in 20 s · score 2400 · rank Makunouchi · then: results\nroute: 22 beats, 3 teleports, invisibility switched on in 1 beat(s), god mode on\nobjectives: sake done, climb done, boss done, dis (optional) done\nthe game reported: grapple ×4, checkpoint ×4, voice lines spoken ×5, kill by strike ×1\nboss defeated: Chamberlain Kurogane: \"The mask... was hungrier... than I...\"\nsongs: m3, boss, results\nheard in play: \"When does my watch end?\" · \"Keep your voice down.\" · \"Hush, the guards can hear you.\" · \"Another cold night...\" · \"My feet hurt.\" · \"Such a pretty night.\"\nthe game's own shapes placed: 17 kinds, 45 props\n\n### Rice and Ash (m1, kaede, missions): WON in 29 s · score 1625 · rank Ekiben · then: results\nroute: 14 beats, 3 teleports, invisibility switched on in 1 beat(s), god mode on\nobjectives: kill done, ledger (optional) done, boss done, escape done\nthe game reported: checkpoint ×2, grapple ×1, pickup ×1, Silent Cut (back) ×1, kill by cut ×1, voice lines spoken ×11, detected ×1, kill by strike ×2\nboss defeated: Gonroku: \"The rice... was always... his...\"\nsongs: m1, boss, results\nheard in play: \"Guards! Guards!\" · \"Is someone there?\" · \"...Must have been the wind.\" · \"Is that the moon or a rice cake? I am too hungry to know.\" · \"The barracks rice tastes of sand.\" · \"Nothing. Back to my post.\"\nthe game's own shapes placed: 20 kinds, 58 props\n\n### Night Delivery (delivery, sojiro, trial): WON in 3 s · then: trialResults\nroute: 9 beats, 2 teleports, invisibility switched on in 1 beat(s), god mode on\nobjectives: kill done, escape done\nthe game reported: Silent Cut (back) ×1, kill by cut ×1, voice lines spoken ×1\nsongs: m1, results\nheard in play: \"Guards! Guards!\" · \"Hm? What was that?\"\nthe game's own shapes placed: 13 kinds, 24 props\n\n## The words (the tone, as written)\nOpening crawl: \"The Sengoku era. Lords devour lords, and the land devours the poor.\" / \"In Kasugai Province the granaries are full, and the people starve.\" / \"In the shadow of Kokaku Castle stands a humble shop, the Jubako-ya.\" / \"It sells lunchboxes to the lord's household. Every box has two tiers.\" / \"So does the shop.\"\nPrologue: \"granny: Rice that is never tested is only seed. Tonight, you two are tested.\" / \"kaede: Finally. Six years of folding boxes.\" / \"sojiro: ...We are ready, Master.\" / \"granny: Ready? The rice says when it is ready. Not the cook. Go.\"\nBriefing, Rice and Ash: \"takanori: Magistrate Kanemori swears the harvest failed. Yet his storehouses groan with rice.\" / \"kuroganeRobe: My lord, Kanemori has served your house for twenty years. To accuse without proof is--\" / \"takanori: Enough, Kurogane. Leave us.\" / \"takanori: Grandmother. The law cannot reach him. Can your boxes?\"\nKokaku, if the moon rises first: \"takanori: The moon is generous tonight. A cup to its health...\"\nGuards: idle \"Another cold night...\" · chat \"Did you hear? The magistrate has eel tonight.\" · notice \"Hm? What was that?\" · search \"Show yourself!\" · lost \"...Must have been the wind.\" · alert \"Intruder!\" · bell \"To the bell!\" · body \"He's... dead?!\"\n\n## The inventory\nCharacters: Sojiro, Kaede\nMissions: The Trial of the Second Tier, Rice and Ash, The Fort at Kiri Lake, Moon over Kokaku, Night Delivery\nBosses: Brother Ittetsu (3 moves), Gonroku (4 moves, 2 phases), Hotaru (4 moves, 2 phases), Chamberlain Kurogane (7 moves, 2 phases)\nTools: Rice Ball, Poison Rice Ball, Sleep Dango, Sour Plum, Shuriken, Smoke Bomb, Caltrops, Firecracker, Fire Pot, Straw Cloak\nEnemies: ashigaru, samurai, archer, ninja, hound, civ\nDev Mode: 32 live sliders on 4 pages (Hero, Guards, Combat, World), plus Cheats, Mission, Teleport and Debug view pages\nAttract vignettes: rooftops, silentcut, rice, moat, smoke, oni, report\nThe game's own shapes: 34 (stoneLantern, paperLantern, lanternString, torii, bamboo, maple, cherry, persimmonTree, bonsaiPine, steppingStones, sakeBarrel, riceBale, jubako, yatai, weaponRack, mato, taiko, hansho, waterBarrel, strawMat, boat, riceBarge, mooringPost, bambooCage, lever, leverDown, shachihoko, dummy, sakeFlask, strongbox, kotatsu, folding, hut, nets)\n\n## The art, drawn (Chromium, the shipped file: the game's own shapes each mission draws as the hero goes through its zones)\ntraining (5 zones): 17 kinds drawn: stoneLantern, paperLantern, torii, bamboo, cherry, persimmonTree, bonsaiPine, steppingStones, sakeBarrel, riceBale, jubako, weaponRack, mato, taiko, waterBarrel, strawMat, dummy\nm1 (8 zones): 18 kinds drawn: stoneLantern, paperLantern, torii, cherry, bonsaiPine, steppingStones, sakeBarrel, riceBale, jubako, yatai, weaponRack, mato, hansho, waterBarrel, boat, mooringPost, kotatsu, folding\nm2 (5 zones): 13 kinds drawn: paperLantern, sakeBarrel, riceBale, weaponRack, hansho, waterBarrel, boat, riceBarge, mooringPost, bambooCage, lever, hut, nets\nm3 (5 zones): 17 kinds drawn: stoneLantern, paperLantern, lanternString, torii, maple, bonsaiPine, steppingStones, sakeBarrel, riceBale, yatai, weapon