{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcQKnrgoGwgZfQzudo1SCN","type":"tool_result","content":"// my-3D2dge game checker: loads a game in a headless browser, presses start, plays it for a\n// moment, switches through the game's camera views, and reports errors, warnings, frame rate,\n// how much of the window the picture covers (covers: 1 = no black bars), how much is actually on screen, and screenshots.\n//\n// Setup (once):   npm install          (installs Playwright)\n//                 npx playwright install chromium\n// Usage:          node tools/check.mjs path/to/game.html[#scene] [--seconds 4] [--out check-output] [--size 390x844@3]\n//                 (--size: the window in CSS pixels and its pixel density; @2 and up is a phone or tablet, with touch)\n// Exit code is 1 if the page threw any error or never drew anything, so agents and CI can rely on it.\n// A game that sets game.debug = { snapshot() { return {...} } } gets its snapshot printed after play (its own state:\n// the hero, the objective, what an agent needs to see the game is where it should be).\nimport { chromium } from 'playwright';\nmy-3D2dge check: ../Bentou2BirthOfTheLunchboxAssassins-Tenchu2BirthOfTheStealthAssassins-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331.html (engine 0.85.2, build dev-build)\n  load          scene title       60 fps  2 characters  5 draws  83% filled  68 colors  427x240\n  after start   scene charSelect  60 fps  2 characters  2 draws  8% filled  26 colors  427x240\n  after play    scene crawl       60 fps  0 characters  0 draws  4% filled  9 colors  427x240\n  view iso            60 fps  update 0.1 ms  draw 0.4 ms  0 characters  4% filled\n  view threequarter   60 fps  update 0.1 ms  draw 1.2 ms  0 characters  5% filled\n  note: 3 screenshot(s) are almost empty (under 6% of pixels differ from the background). Check the camera (game.focus) and the screenshots.\n  game.debug.snapshot(): {\"scene\":\"crawl\",\"paused\":false,\"t\":0}\n  look 