{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghG6ctdGjD39AAaLt9Tu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things in this feedback I can act on directly.\n\n**A wrong claim.** I said the title shows on \"the title, character select and phone screens\". Character select shows \"CHOOSE YOUR APPRENTICE\", not the title. That was an error, and I'll replace it with what's actually observed.\n\n**Thin evidence for L3 (genre) and L15 (art).** I'll add raw numbers from the shipped file rather than pass/fail:\n- **Genre:** the stealth model measured in play: light versus shadow, sound and the alarm.\n- **Art:** the period gear the cast wears and the game's own wall faces and roof caps, all as drawn.\n\nFirst the title screen itself, from a clean load:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5968,"cache_read_input_tokens":325715,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5968},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"b34c1bb9-9b18-4993-bf91-de544ab8eeb9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:32:04.338Z","request_id":"req_011CghG6caXfmezbxXgG8D8w"}
