gine's Humanoid gear, patch 3): sword ×4, jingasa ×4, spear ×3, band ×3, mask cloth ×2, kabuto with crest ×2, sashimono banner ×2, bow ×1\nthe world: 2 kawara roof caps, 1 halls whose roofs fade when you enter\n## The stealth model, measured (Rice and Ash, guard \"court\", the shipped scripts)\nstanding in its lantern light 50 px ahead (light 0.23): exposure 0.29, the guard's suspicion peaked at 1.20, alert after 2.50 s (alert)\ncrouched in its shadow 80 px ahead (light 0.22): exposure 0.26, the guard's suspicion peaked at 0.00, never alerted in 5 s (calm)\nrunning 50 px behind it (out of its view): exposure 0.34, the guard's suspicion peaked at 0.00, never alerted in 0.7 s (calm)\ncreeping (crouched) 50 px behind it: exposure 0.31, the guard's suspicion peaked at 0.00, never alerted in 1 s (calm)\nan alerted samurai (\"hallguard\"), 14 s later: voice lines spoken ×4, bell rung ×1 · heard: \"Sound the bell!\" · \"Guards! Guards!\" · \"Ring the alarm!\" · \"When does my watch end?\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654","uuid":"de7ca533-8baf-480a-9922-80a66c80e4b9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:34:23.184Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"exit 0\n### The Trial of the Second Tier (training, sojiro, story): WON in 45 s · score 2100 · rank Makunouchi · then: results\nthe cast wears and carries (the engine's Humanoid gear, patch 3): sword ×7, mask cloth ×6, jingasa ×1, spear ×1\nthe world: 2 kawara roof caps, 0 halls whose roofs fade when you enter\n### Rice and Ash (m1, sojiro, story): WON in 16 s · score 1625 · rank Ekiben · then: results\nthe cast wears and carries (the engine's Humanoid gear, patch 3): jingasa ×10, spear ×9, sword ×5, kabuto with crest ×4, sashimono banner ×4, mask cloth ×1, bow ×1, band ×1, club ×1\nthe world: 24 kawara roof caps, 1 halls whose roofs fade when you enter\n### The Fort at Kiri Lake (m2, sojiro, story): WON in 20 s · score 2400 · rank Makunouchi · then: results\nthe cast wears and c